  "body": "See https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/302 where I initially filed this request. @annevk's suggestion that we handle the header inside the navigation algorithm (probably as step 21, after the response checks?) SGTM.\n\nThis will require some changes to CSP as well to move `frame-ancestors` from a response check in Fetch to a new check in the navigate algorithm.\n",
